invalid type: string "Question: How many videos were uploaded in March 2026?\nSQL:\nCANNOT_ANSWER: The dataset only covers March 2025 to February 2026. March 2026 data is not available.", expected a booleanAND published_platform IS NOT NULL\nGROUP BY uploaded_by, published_platform\nQUALIFY ROW_NUMBER() OVER (\n    PARTITION BY uploaded_by\n    ORDER BY COUNT(*) DESC\n) = 1\nORDER BY uploaded_by;"